stream
BT /F1 32 Tf 56 480 Td (Total revenue) Tj ET
BT /F1 18 Tf 56 410 Td (Total revenue is price times quantity sold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 18 Tf 56 374 Td (When demand is inelastic, a price rise increases total revenue, because quantity barely falls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 18 Tf 56 338 Td (When demand is elastic, a price rise reduces total revenue, because quantity falls a lot.) Tj ET
endstream
