BT /F1 32 Tf 56 480 Td (Unit elastic demand) Tj ET
BT /F1 18 Tf 56 410 Td (When elasticity is exactly 1, a small price change leaves total revenue unchanged.) Tj ET
BT /F1 18 Tf 56 374 Td (Along a straight demand line, revenue is highest at the midpoint, where demand is unit elastic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 18 Tf 56 338 Td (Above the midpoint demand is elastic; below it, inelastic.) Tj ET
endstream
